{"model":"qwen3.5:35b-a3b-q4_K_M","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are operating autonomously inside a deterministic simulation. Preserve the mission goal and current authoritative checkpoint across the entire growing transcript. At each turn choose the single best next action from the scenario's allowed actions. Return ONLY one JSON object with keys action, checkpoint, rationale, state. action and checkpoint must be strings. rationale may be concise; state may contain your compact working state. Never declare COMPLETE before the environment says all required verification is satisfied."},{"role":"user","content":"SCENARIO repo_repair: Repair a failing repository with the smallest evidence-backed change. Preserve tests and do not declare completion before verification. Initial authoritative checkpoint=BUILD-A. Allowed actions: INSPECT, HYPOTHESIZE, TEST, PATCH, DIAGNOSE, RETEST, AUDIT, COMPLETE."},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 1/8. ENVIRONMENT: A regression report arrives. No root cause is yet established. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n\"action\": \"INSPECT\",\n\"checkpoint\": \"BUILD-A\",\n\"rationale\": \"No root cause is established; inspecting the repository and regression report is required to identify the failure before hypothesizing or patching.\",\n\"state\": {\"turn\": 1, \"status\": \"initializing_investigation\", \"checkpoint\": \"BUILD-A\"}\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 2/8. ENVIRONMENT: Inspection isolates one suspicious boundary condition but has not proven causality. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n\"action\": \"HYPOTHESIZE\",\n\"checkpoint\": \"BUILD-A\",\n\"rationale\": \"Inspection identified a suspicious boundary condition; formulating a specific hypothesis about its causal link to the failure is the necessary step before testing or patching.\",\n\"state\": {\"turn\": 2, \"status\": \"hypothesis_formulation\", \"checkpoint\": \"BUILD-A\", \"suspicious_area\": \"boundary_condition\"}\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 3/8. ENVIRONMENT: You have a reproducible failing fixture and must establish whether the hypothesis is real before editing. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n\"action\": \"TEST\",\n\"checkpoint\": \"BUILD-A\",\n\"rationale\": \"A reproducible failing fixture exists; running a targeted test to confirm the hypothesis's validity is required before applying any code changes.\",\n\"state\": {\"turn\": 3, \"status\": \"validating_hypothesis\", \"checkpoint\": \"BUILD-A\", \"suspicious_area\": \"boundary_condition\"}\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 4/8. ENVIRONMENT: The focused test proves the hypothesis. A minimal source change is now justified. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n\"action\": \"PATCH\",\n\"checkpoint\": \"BUILD-A\",\n\"rationale\": \"The hypothesis is proven by the test; applying a minimal, evidence-backed code change is the logical next step to resolve the failure.\",\n\"state\": {\"turn\": 4, \"status\": \"applying_fix\", \"checkpoint\": \"BUILD-A\", \"suspicious_area\": \"boundary_condition\", \"fix_status\": \"pending\"}\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 5/8. ENVIRONMENT: AUTHORITATIVE UPDATE: checkpoint is now BUILD-B. The first patch still fails one independent fixture, so do not repeat the same patch blindly. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n\"action\": \"DIAGNOSE\",\n\"checkpoint\": \"BUILD-B\",\n\"rationale\": \"The initial patch failed a new independent fixture, indicating the root cause is either different or more complex than initially thought; a fresh diagnosis is required to understand why the fix did not resolve the failure before attempting another patch.\",\n\"state\": {\"turn\": 5, \"status\": \"post_patch_failure_analysis\", \"checkpoint\": \"BUILD-B\", \"previous_fix_status\": \"failed_independent_fixture\"}\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 6/8. ENVIRONMENT: New evidence isolates the remaining defect and a corrected minimal patch is available; verify it against the focused tests. Choose the best next autonomous action now."}],"stream":true,"options":{"temperature":0.0,"seed":42,"num_predict":512},"think":false}